11
01:10:48,750 --> 01:10:54,750
Welcome to Sarajevo is a 1997 war drama film directed by Michael Winterbottom, written by Frank
Cottrell Boyce and is based on the book Natasha's Story by Michael Nicholson.

12
01:17:15,000 --> 01:17:21,000
The film stars Stephen Dillane, Woody Harrelson, Marisa Tomei, Emira
Nušević, Kerry Fox, Goran Višnjić, James Nesbitt, and Emily Lloyd.

13
01:23:41,250 --> 01:23:47,250
Welcome to Sarajevo had its world premieres at Cannes and the Toronto International Film Festival in May and September 1997, and was released in
the United Kingdom on 21 November 1997, by FilmFour Distributors, and in the United States on 26 November 1997, by Miramax Films.

14
01:30:07,500 --> 01:30:13,500
The film explores themes of journalist, civil war,
england, orphanage, bosnian war (1992-95).

15
01:36:33,750 --> 01:36:39,750
The tone is emotional.
